        "ai_gen_block_41479e3_yyzcqt": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_41479e3",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customer reviews",
            "heading_size": 28,
            "desktop_cards": "5",
            "mobile_cards": "1.2",
            "card_background": "#ffffff",
            "border_color": "#ececec",
            "corner_radius": 14,
            "star_color": "#c9a26d",
            "show_arrows": true,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "review_1_photo": "shopify://shop_images/4_243d4fc5-f209-4d68-b9bf-461eb434b57d.webp",
            "review_1_name": "Charlotte",
            "review_1_rating": "5",
            "review_1_title": "",
            "review_1_text": "Ok I need to be honest. I bought this because I saw it on TikTok and thought “there’s no way that tiny thing fits me.” Girl. TRUST THE PROCESS. I’m a size L and it stretched perfectly. My tummy is completely flat, my butt looks lifted like I got work done, and I wore it under a silk dress to a wedding — nobody had a clue. Only “problem”: I now refuse to wear my old shapewear. Already ordered 2 more colors.",
            "review_2_photo": "shopify://shop_images/5_880ce862-7b6b-44e6-ae53-e041e0a95f38.webp",
            "review_2_name": "Ida",
            "review_2_rating": "5",
            "review_2_title": "",
            "review_2_text": "What stressed me most about shapewear was the bathroom situation. Every time I wore my old faja with hooks I had to do a full strip-down 💀 This has the open gusset and it’s a GAME CHANGER. 30 seconds, done, no drama. I tested it under jeans, under a bodycon dress, even under white pants, invisible everywhere. And girls, the back fat? Smooth. Completely smooth. Small flaw: the nude color runs slightly darker than expected, more of a beige. But I’m rebuying anyway.",
            "review_3_photo": "shopify://shop_images/1_6c402593-fa8d-4702-8aef-7a3e0846d245.webp",
            "review_3_name": "Sophie",
            "review_3_rating": "5",
            "review_3_title": "",
            "review_3_text": "4 months postpartum and I was so insecure about my mom pouch. I’ve tried 3 different shapewear before this, one suffocated me, one rolled up constantly, one made my butt completely flat. This one? Mom pouch GONE. Butt LIFTED. And the craziest part? I wore it for 10 hours yesterday and forgot I had it on. Only thing: it took me a minute to get past my hips because the compression zone is really firm, but once it’s on… wow. Just wow.",
            "review_4_photo": "shopify://shop_images/r3.webp",
            "review_4_name": "Hannah",
            "review_4_rating": "5",
            "review_4_title": "",
            "review_4_text": "I’m a 2XL and I was SO skeptical. Most shapewear in my size either doesn’t compress enough or compresses everything including my lungs 😂 This is different. The tummy part is really firm and strong — it works. But the chest and legs? Totally breathable. I can actually breathe AND look snatched. My boyfriend saw me in a dress and goes “you look incredible.” He didn’t know I was wearing anything underneath. That’s when I knew this was the one. Get your size, trust me.",
            "review_5_photo": "shopify://shop_images/6_7923fbe1-3b67-4fde-8144-8477be79dfb6.webp",
            "review_5_name": "Inès",
            "review_5_rating": "5",
            "review_5_title": "",
            "review_5_text": "I’ve been wearing shapewear every day for years. I’ve tried everything — fajas with zippers, ones with hooks, cheap ones from Amazon, expensive ones. This is the first one where I don’t count the minutes until I can take it off. The zoned compression thing is real: belly is locked in, everything else is comfortable. I wore it from 7am to 11pm at a friend’s wedding. Dancing, eating, bathroom breaks — zero issues. Only flaw if I have to say one: the straps could be slightly thicker for larger busts. But honestly, still the best I’ve ever tried."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
